<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz W seeks main mkt listing.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz W seeks main mkt listing.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Elektromontaz Warszawa SA has applied to the Warsaw Stock Exchange to transfer to the bourse's main market from its parallel floor, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bourse's parallel floor lists smaller, less-liquid stocks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
